#8501
"By the Front Gates"
"The bare limestone walls are unmarked save for the arrow slits in either
wall.  Underfoot the floor has been worn smooth by years of wear.  North of
you stands a heavy wooden gate that looks as if it could withstand anything
short of the heaviest siege equipment.  Far to the south you can still make
out the entrance to the fort.
"
"[Maelthar] murder holes here
[Nereus] gate north
[Nereus] murder hole rooms are 8539, 8540
[Maelthar] gate open by default, only closes if outside mob gets attacked
[Maelthar] acodes for getting shot up
[Maelthar] extras
