#8502
"Under the Inner Gatehouse"
"This room is rather small and is dominated by the huge gate in the southern
wall.  Two smaller versions have been set into both the eastern and western
walls, both of which appear to bolt from the other side.  An archway to the
north leads into a couryard.
"
"[Nereus] gate south
[Nereus] doors east, west
[Maelthar] doors locked if front entrance is breached violently
[Maelthar] extras
