#8503
"East of the Gatehouse"
"Grey limestone walls have grown nearly black from years of smoke buildup. 
Sconces line the walls every few feet, providing enough light to see by but
not enough for you to make out the finer details of the keep's craftsmanship.
The passage through the keep's walls continues to the east, but to the west is
an archway set with a wooden gate.
"
"[Nereus] secret passage south, need searching
[Nereus] hallway inside wall
[Maelthar] hidden, searchable
[Maelthar] extras
