#8504
"West of the Gatehouse"
"In the flickering light that torches on both walls provide you can see that
the grey limestone is covered in soot and grime.  This corridor under the
walls seems to be the main artery through the keep.  Far to the west the
passage turns out of view and to the east an arch set with a gate stands in
case of invasion.
"
"[Nereus] secret passage to murder hole room south
[Nereus] hallway is inside walls of keep
[Maelthar] its hidden but searchable
[Maelthar] extras
