#8505
"Inside the Walls"
"A slight breeze wafts into the hall here from a small chamber built into the
southern wall, causing the torch flames to dance.  Though the walls are coated
with soot you notice that the sconces are clean of rust and kept in good
repair.  The dim hallway continues east and west.
"
"[Maelthar] extras
