#8507
"Guard Post"
"Two flickering torches set into either wall provide light for this tiny
chamber.  The greyish stone walls have arrow slits every few feet that let a
cool breeze into confines of the castle.  Looking to the north you can see a
long corridor that continues as far as you can see.
"
"[Maelthar] average strength guard here
[Maelthar] extras
