#8508
"Guard Post"
"The southern wall of this chamber is lined with arrow slits which allow a cool
breeze into the otherwise stale air of the castle.  Two torches on the eastern
and western walls are all that is required to light this tiny chamber.  A
large hallway running east and west lies to the north but you can make out
little of what stands in those directions from here.
"
