#8550
"Chapel Entrance"
"Unlike the simplistic design of the rest of the fortress this chamber has a
vaulted ceiling and is richly decorated.  A huge set of double doors on the
eastern wall have been carved with images of Lonil.  The floor is smooth and
to either side of a long carpet mosaics of battles have been carefully built
into the stone floor.  To the west you can see an altar and a huge
stained-glass window.
"
"[Nereus] chapel area
[Nereus] or hallway to chapels here
[Nereus] big ass door east
[Maelthar] extras
